OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire volunteer groups receive
OL,4,AKing's Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Caribbean sports club, a community
OL,7,Flibrary, and a group that runs
OL,8,Finclusive club nights for disabled
OL,9,Fyoung people have been given a royal
OL,10,Faward for voluntary service.
OL,12,FSheffield Caribbean Sports Club,
OL,13,FBroomhill Community Trust and
OL,14,FExclusively Inclusive in Skipton all
OL,15,Freceived the award, which is equivalent
OL,16,Fto an MBE.
OL,18,FThe King's Award for Voluntary Service,
OL,19,Fwhich recognises outstanding
OL,20,Fcontributions to communities, was given
OL,21,Fto 250 UK charities, social enterprises
OL,22,Fand voluntary groups in 2026.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
